  "source_correspondence": "Actual named signed seeded H2 pair contribution is exactly1/h\u00b2 times actual whole-point second derivative. Actual moment-dominated product-permutation Fubini moves all copies and Gaussians; the two Gaussian halves collapse under their proved actual law; the repeated whitened copy reconstructs the physical original copy AE; sigma\u00b2 is canceled only from hpos:t+epsilon>0. No concentration, remainder or analytic identity is assumed.",
