        "expanded_type": "\u2200 {\u03a9 : Type u_1} [inst : MeasurableSpace \u03a9] {p r n : \u2115} {\u03bc : MeasureTheory.Measure \u03a9}\n  [inst_1 : MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure \u03bc] {\u03be : Fin n \u2192 \u03a9 \u2192 RectangleCLT.Vector p} {\u03b4 : \u211d},\n  RectangleCLT.BoundedIndependentHypotheses \u03bc \u03be \u03b4 \u2192\n    \u2200 (A : Matrix (Fin p) (Fin r) \u211d),\n      A * A.transpose = RectangleCLT.covariance \u03bc (RectangleCLT.sumVector \u03be) \u2192\n        (\u2200 (j : Fin p), RectangleCLT.covariance \u03bc (RectangleCLT.sumVector \u03be) j j = 1) \u2192\n          \u2200 (s : RectangleCLT.FaceSmoother p) (x : RectangleCLT.Vector p) (f g : RectangleCLT.Face p),\n            f \u2260 g \u2192\n              \u2200 {\u03b5 t \u03b8 : \u211d},\n                0 \u2264 \u03b5 \u2192\n                  t \u2208 Set.Icc 0 1 \u2192\n                    0 < t + \u03b5 \u2192\n                      \u2200 (freshY freshW freshShift : Bool),\n                        RectangleCLTArxivV1.capSeededPairContribution s \u03bc \u03be A x \u03b5 t \u03b8 f g freshY freshW freshShift =\n                          1 / s.bandwidth ^ 2 *\n                            \u222b (\u03c9 : (Fin n \u2192 RectangleCLT.Vector p) \u00d7 RectangleCLT.Vector r),\n                              \u2211 i,\n                                \u222b (a : \u03a9 \u00d7 \u03a9),\n                                  RectangleCLTArxivV1.capRectangularPairCoefficient A f g\n                                      (RectangleCLTArxivV1.capOriginalCopy \u03be freshY i a)\n                                      (RectangleCLTArxivV1.capOriginalCopy \u03be freshW i a) *\n                                    RectangleCLTArxivV1.capSoftFaceSecond s {f, g}\n                                      (RectangleCLTArxivV1.capOriginalCopy \u03be false i a)\n                                      (RectangleCLTArxivV1.capSeededWholeValue A x \u03b5 t \u03c9 +\n                                        RectangleCLTArxivV1.capSeededCopyShift \u03be freshShift t \u03b8 i\n                                          (\u03c9,\n                                            a)) \u2202\u03bc.prod\n                                    \u03bc \u2202(RectangleCLT.bernoulliArrayLaw \u03bc \u03be t).prod (RectangleCLT.standardGaussian r)",
